    {
      "scene_id": "C05_亲手琢磨过的礼物",
      "sourceIds": [
        "M305",
        "M306",
        "M309",
        "M310",
        "M311",
        "M312",
        "M313"
      ],
      "interlocutor": "玛尔纱；在维尔汀旁听时探病",
      "situation": "她带来的鸟形礼物来自自己读过的书和学生时期失败的设计；后来重新改进，终于能动。",
      "speech_acts": [
        "分享兴趣",
        "解释试做过程",
        "表达具体牵挂",
        "坦率承认效果未知"
      ],
      "original_lines": [
        {
          "sourceId": "M305",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "我是在《珍奇神秘学生物饲养者走访札记》里看到的。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-01",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 195,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L195"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M306",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "很可爱吧，书上的还原图画得很粗糙，看不清的地方我就自己发挥了一下。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-01",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 197,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L197"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M309",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "我在总部待命的这段时间整理了一些读书时的旧东西，找到了我当时在上课时偷偷画的“设计图”。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-01",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 205,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L205"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M310",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "当时我想用神秘术做一只能动会飞的模型，不过失败了。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-01",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 207,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L207"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M311",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "我想，说不定现在我的施术能力比过去要好一点，所以我试着把当时的想法重新整理，再稍加改进了一下……",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-01",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 209,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L209"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M312",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "然后，我就做出了这个。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-01",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 211,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L211"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M313",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "希望它能代替我陪着你。我在附魔的时候还加上了很多很多我能想到的咒语，大概都是“早日康复”之类的用途……呃，倒也不知道有没有用。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-01",
