          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3517"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M489",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "只有我一个人的话，行动会灵活很多，更容易躲开它们的攻击。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3519,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3519"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M491",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "你们搞清楚门后的秘密，我去把“鸽子”带回来。虽然离开底座会加剧鸽子的能源消耗，但撑过回溯的那一瞬间应该是够的！",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3523,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3523"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M492",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "但、但是……说到底，现在没有人确定门里是不是真的有办法，你们也需要运气，不是吗？",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3527,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3527"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M493",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "我是想，把我们的运气都加在一起！让我也分担一部分“暴雨”的危险……",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3531,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3531"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M494",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "如果你们回不来，我一个人肯定没有办法把学生们安全地带到中央瞭望塔。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3533,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3533"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M495",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "可让我去把气象鸽带回来，我们就有了两手准备，学生也有了双份的生存率。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3535,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3535"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M496",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "我的队长总会在作战之前做两手准备，他教过我们如何制定备用计划。",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3537,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3537"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "M497",
          "speaker": "梅蕾尔",
          "text": "这就是……我想到的备用计划！",
          "chapter": "他者的悲哀",
          "stage": "13-12",
          "sourceFile": "mainline/113-他者的悲哀.md",
          "line": 3539,
          "url": "https://github.com/VioletWilde/Reverse1999-Story-Compendium/blob/7820ec20ec67d4dec02b8ea72cd683d9d1a96288/readable/story_reader_linked/zh-CN/mainline/113-%E4%BB%96%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80.md?plain=1#L3539"
        }
